  "label": "User projected onto the viewer-targeted scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene where the man is aiming directly at the viewer, creating a direct address. The text 'aim. wait. fire.' reinforces this projection by instructing the viewer (the user) to take action, making the user the implicit 'you' in the command. The man's intense gaze and the direct aiming posture create a visual deictic that targets the user as the recipient of the action.",
